  ------------------------------

  ✅ TreeMap Methods Table
 | Method             | Description                 |
 | ------------------ | --------------------------- |
 | `put(K, V)`        | Inserts key-value pair      |
 | `get(K)`           | Returns value for given key |
 | `remove(K)`        | Removes key-value pair      |
 | `containsKey(K)`   | Checks if key exists        |
 | `containsValue(V)` | Checks if value exists      |
 | `size()`           | Returns number of entries   |
 | `isEmpty()`        | Checks if map is empty      |
 | `clear()`          | Removes all entries         |

  🔹 Sorting & Navigation Methods
| Method          | Description              |
| --------------- | ------------------------ |
| `firstKey()`    | Returns smallest key     |
| `lastKey()`     | Returns largest key      |
| `ceilingKey(K)` | Smallest key ≥ given key |
| `floorKey(K)`   | Largest key ≤ given key  |
| `higherKey(K)`  | Smallest key > given key |
| `lowerKey(K)`   | Largest key < given key  |

  🔹 Entry-based Methods
 | Method             | Description                   |
 | ------------------ | ----------------------------- |
 | `firstEntry()`     | Returns first key-value pair  |
 | `lastEntry()`      | Returns last key-value pair   |
 | `pollFirstEntry()` | Removes & returns first entry |
 | `pollLastEntry()`  | Removes & returns last entry  |

  🔹 View Methods
 | Method       | Description             |
 | ------------ | ----------------------- |
 | `keySet()`   | Returns all keys        |
 | `values()`   | Returns all values      |
 | `entrySet()` | Returns key-value pairs |

  🔹 Range Methods
  | Method                   | Description                |
  | ------------------------ | -------------------------- |
  | `subMap(fromKey, toKey)` | Returns part of map        |
  | `headMap(toKey)`         | Keys less than given key   |
  | `tailMap(fromKey)`       | Keys greater than or equal |
